---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal & Privacy Policy | Cookies | D-VIEW Invisible Grills"
  description="Read D-VIEW Solutions privacy policy, terms of service, installation warranties, and cookie usage guidelines for Andhra Pradesh."
  canonicalUrl="https://dviewsolutions.com/privacy"
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-xs font-bold text-[#16A34A] uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span>Customer Trust & Governance</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          LEGAL, PRIVACY & <span class="text-[#16A34A]">COOKIES</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Clear, transparent policies for homeowners across Andhra Pradesh engaging D-VIEW Solutions for architectural invisible grills and safety installations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        
        {/* Section 1: Privacy Policy */}
        <section id="privacy" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            1. Privacy Policy & Data Collection
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              At D-VIEW Solutions, we respect your privacy. When you schedule a site visit, request an instant quote, or contact our concierge via WhatsApp or phone (+91 62816 20716), we collect minimal essential details: your name, phone number, city, and approximate balcony dimensions.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Zero Spam Guarantee:</strong> Your phone number is strictly utilized by our authorized local installation technicians to confirm your doorstep measurement timing. We never sell, lease, or distribute your private contact details to third-party marketing companies.
            </p>
            <p>
              Direct contact inquiries sent to <a href="mailto:dviewsolutions32@gmail.com" class="text-[#16A34A] font-bold hover:underline">dviewsolutions32@gmail.com</a> are retained securely only for technical correspondence and post-installation warranty validation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section 2: 10-Year Warranty & Legal Terms */}
        <section id="legal" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            2. Legal Terms & 10-Year Warranty Certificate
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              All invisible grill installations carried out by D-VIEW authorized engineers come with an official physical/digital <strong>10-Year Written Anti-Rust Warranty Certificate</strong>.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Certified SS-316 Marine Metallurgy:</strong> Guaranteed against pitting, saline oxidation, and mechanical sag when operated under standard architectural conditions.</li>
              <li><strong>Structural Fasteners & Anodized Tracks:</strong> Installed using certified 6063-T6 track extrusions and Hilti/Fischer high-tensile anchors.</li>
              <li><strong>Exclusions:</strong> Warranty does not cover willful vandalism, cutting with heavy hydraulic power cutters during burglary attempts, or structural building masonry collapses outside our anchor points.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section 3: Cookie Policy */}
        <section id="cookies" class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A]"></span>
            3. Cookie Policy
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
            <p>
              Our website uses essential and performance cookies to provide a smooth browsing experience:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Essential Session Storage:</strong> Used to temporarily remember your site preferences and selected regional city hub so you don't lose your place while exploring different services and corridors.</li>
              <li><strong>Anonymous Performance Metrics:</strong> Helps us analyze page load speeds across desktop and mobile devices throughout Visakhapatnam, Vijayawada, Rajamahendravaram, Guntur, Kakinada, Nellore, and Ongole.</li>
              <li><strong>No Intrusive Ad Tracking:</strong> We do not deploy cross-site tracking pixels or invasive behavioral advertising networks.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
              You can disable cookies at any time via your browser settings without affecting core browsing capabilities on our site.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Contact Info Box */}
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-slate-900">Have Questions or Need Official Documents?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Our compliance and customer relations desk is always ready to assist you.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <a href="tel:+916281620716" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white border border-emerald-300 text-slate-900 font-bold text-xs hover:bg-emerald-50 transition">
              📞 +91 62816 20716
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:dviewsolutions32@gmail.com" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#16A34A] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">
              ✉️ Email Legal Desk
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
